# The Start menu of my-panel. One entry per line: Label|command|icon
# The icon is a name from the Adwaita icon theme (/usr/share/icons/Adwaita)
# or a full path to a PNG. A line with only "-" draws a separator.
Terminal|xterm|utilities-terminal
Files|pcmanfm ~|system-file-manager
Web browser|netsurf-gtk3|web-browser
Text editor|xterm -name editor -T "Text editor" -e nano|accessories-text-editor
System monitor|xterm -name monitor -T "System monitor" -e htop|computer
Calculator|xcalc|accessories-calculator
Clock|xclock|x-office-calendar
Search files|my-search-gui|system-search
File history|my-history|document-open-recent
-
Log out|openbox --exit|system-log-out
Reboot|my-power reboot|view-refresh
Power off|my-power poweroff|system-shutdown
